allow init system_file file { execute_no_trans mounton }
allow init vendor_file file { execute_no_trans mounton }
dontaudit init kernel process { call }
dontaudit zygote zygote process { ptrace }
dontaudit untrusted_app* untrusted_app* process { ptrace }
dontaudit untrusted_app* sysfs_net dir { search read }
dontaudit untrusted_app* su_exec file { execute read open }
